{"unit_id":"HakureiMonika__dsh-browser-scope#feature-f01","repo":"HakureiMonika/dsh-browser-scope","commit":"cd9079cd6f4803cbadfd81197cfd19586750f3e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BrowserScope 的功能「页面浏览与交互」：agent 可管理标签页、导航、读取页面快照，并点击、输入、滚动和选择控件。通过 browser_* 工具调用，结果返回当前页面状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:463","src/index.ts:486","src/index.ts:502"]}
{"unit_id":"HakureiMonika__dsh-browser-scope#feature-f02","repo":"HakureiMonika/dsh-browser-scope","commit":"cd9079cd6f4803cbadfd81197cfd19586750f3e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BrowserScope 的功能「控制台与网络检查」：读取页面控制台消息和网络请求元数据，也可控制暂停的请求、查看响应内容或重放选定请求。通过 DSH 浏览器工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:547","src/index.ts:553","src/index.ts:615"]}
{"unit_id":"HakureiMonika__dsh-browser-scope#feature-f03","repo":"HakureiMonika/dsh-browser-scope","commit":"cd9079cd6f4803cbadfd81197cfd19586750f3e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BrowserScope 的功能「JavaScript 调试」：连接页面调试器，设置断点、暂停和单步执行，并读取调用帧、作用域变量与源码映射。通过 browser_debugger 操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:577"]}
{"unit_id":"HakureiMonika__dsh-browser-scope#feature-f04","repo":"HakureiMonika/dsh-browser-scope","commit":"cd9079cd6f4803cbadfd81197cfd19586750f3e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BrowserScope 的功能「性能采集」：对当前页面采集 trace、CPU profile、覆盖率和堆快照，并将大型结果保存为插件管理的 artifact。通过 browser_profile 操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:644","src/artifact-store.ts:43"]}
{"unit_id":"HakureiMonika__dsh-browser-scope#feature-f05","repo":"HakureiMonika/dsh-browser-scope","commit":"cd9079cd6f4803cbadfd81197cfd19586750f3e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BrowserScope 的功能「诊断检查点」：围绕页面操作记录诊断状态、创建检查点并比较前后变化，还可生成诊断报告。通过 browser_diagnose 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:593","src/runtime.ts:4579"]}
{"unit_id":"HakureiMonika__dsh-browser-scope#feature-f06","repo":"HakureiMonika/dsh-browser-scope","commit":"cd9079cd6f4803cbadfd81197cfd19586750f3e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BrowserScope 的功能「右侧栏浏览器工作台」：在 DSH 会话右侧栏显示浏览器面板，并在对话输入区提供控制入口。会话可各自选择是否使用此浏览器工具集。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:1722","src/client/index.tsx:1733","src/index.ts:757"]}
{"unit_id":"HakureiMonika__dsh-browser-scope#feature-f07","repo":"HakureiMonika/dsh-browser-scope","commit":"cd9079cd6f4803cbadfd81197cfd19586750f3e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BrowserScope 的功能「设备与网络模拟」：可为当前页面调整视口、设备、语言、时区、网络、CPU、离线状态和权限。通过 browser_emulate 操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:655"]}
